      "updated": 1778555367810,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CLIENT SIDE\n-runs in user's browser\n-HTML : structure of the web page\n-CSS : styling, colors, fonts, layout\n-JS: interactivity & dynamic content\n-React.js : modern library\n-users can see this code (view source)\n-sends request , receivers, & displays data",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CLIENT SIDE\n-runs in user's browser\n-HTML : structure of the web page\n-CSS : styling, colors, fonts, layout\n-JS: interactivity & dynamic content\n-React.js : modern library\n-users can see this code (view source)\n-sends request , receivers, & displays data",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
