      "updated": 1778555592193,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SERVER SIDE \n-runs on powerful computers in data centers.\n-Node.js : servers side javaScript runtime\n-express.js : handles HTTP request & routers\n-database : stores & retrieves all app data\n-authentication, security, & business logics\n-users cannot see the server side code\n-processes request, sends back response",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SERVER SIDE \n-runs on powerful computers in data centers.\n-Node.js : servers side javaScript runtime\n-express.js : handles HTTP request & routers\n-database : stores & retrieves all app data\n-authentication, security, & business logics\n-users cannot see the server side code\n-processes request, sends back response",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
